This image is an UNMODIFIED build of upstream source at the commit recorded in
the image label org.opencontainers.image.revision. It is repackaged for a
private homelab registry and is not an official upstream release. No upstream
source files were changed; the only additions are this notice, the license
copy, and OCI metadata labels.

Vendored third-party dependencies inside the upstream tree retain their own
license files, as stated in the upstream README.
